WEBVTT

00:00:00.106 --> 00:00:05.722
This video shows how to track overdue library books and take one back on a phone.

00:00:07.397 --> 00:00:11.741
Tap the menu button, open Library and choose Overdue.

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:26.684
The tiles show how many books are overdue, the fines built up so far, and the fine per day.

00:00:35.271 --> 00:00:43.839
Each loan is a card with the book, the borrower, the due date, the days overdue and the fine. The oldest loans are first.

00:00:48.913 --> 00:00:56.305
Tap Return on a card and confirm. A message shows the fine, and the loan leaves the overdue list.

00:01:20.203 --> 00:01:25.507
The book is back, the fine is recorded, and the loan has left the overdue list.
